                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adefde87-69c1-3db1-a5e3-76c503236332",
                                        "entry_id": "679c1627-eec8-31c9-ae7f-160539229d64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A liking for foods that are sweet; a weakness for sweets."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "singular"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fef6e41-678d-48db-a65a-4a822b78333d",
                                                "sense_id": "adefde87-69c1-3db1-a5e3-76c503236332",
                                                "text": "He eats a healthy diet most of the time, but has a sweet tooth when it comes to candy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f420a803-fda3-3560-a5b1-1c5ad9ff6ecd",
                                        "entry_id": "679c1627-eec8-31c9-ae7f-160539229d64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone with a liking for sweet foods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33b733d9-339d-35d5-a35e-293577d148a2",
                                        "entry_id": "679c1627-eec8-31c9-ae7f-160539229d64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An edible fungus of species Hydnum repandum."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "469fff36-7e77-3d8d-9101-2d5099889518",
                                        "entry_id": "679c1627-eec8-31c9-ae7f-160539229d64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A preference, especially for a kind of food."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab5f8dcd-185a-4f3d-8bb6-f70e9bb406ff",
                                                "sense_id": "469fff36-7e77-3d8d-9101-2d5099889518",
                                                "text": "the python has a sweet tooth for rats and mice and the sweet tooth of this particular snake is on edge for a square meal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c160ca57-e53d-45e6-916d-ea2eb177c7ae",
                                                "sense_id": "469fff36-7e77-3d8d-9101-2d5099889518",
                                                "text": "Prowlers are on the loose in suburban Denver. Description: pointy ears, bushy tails and a sweet tooth for poodle and cat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf04ca28-2ecd-4889-a378-6451ecb0e493",
                                                "sense_id": "469fff36-7e77-3d8d-9101-2d5099889518",
                                                "text": "But my grandmother had, in my father's words, a \"sweet tooth” for meat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "263d18aa-8d72-476a-9683-2647e1b08385",
                                                "sense_id": "469fff36-7e77-3d8d-9101-2d5099889518",
                                                "text": "In the same way I developed a craving for doughnuts, my sweet tooth for God's Word developed by repetition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee8d2fb1-167d-4611-9587-18de3bedc17f",
                                                "sense_id": "469fff36-7e77-3d8d-9101-2d5099889518",
                                                "text": "\".... She had a sweet tooth for booze.\" \"Did she have a sweet tooth for drugs?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fe1af02-578d-4c70-a45c-9548bca8df36",
                                                "sense_id": "469fff36-7e77-3d8d-9101-2d5099889518",
                                                "text": "I have high hopes though, because mother always did have a sweet tooth for rather nice men, you see father was tremendously attractive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
